# The release procedure and the development notes are written for whoever
# publishes the material, not for the students who receive it.
DEVELOP.md
RELEASING.md

# A day's README.md is the assistant's notes, at the top of the day and beside
# the data and the notebooks. It says what students are expected to discover,
# so it is never published.
Day*/README.md
Day*/*/README.md

# Solutions are withheld until the session that uses them has finished. Add a
# negation below for one solution to publish it.
**/01_laboratory_exercise_solution.ipynb
!/Day 1 - Introduction and Review/notebooks/01_laboratory_exercise_solution.ipynb
!/Day 2 - Data Preparation and Processing/notebooks/01_laboratory_exercise_solution.ipynb
